The package boost-property-map-parallel is compatible with built-in CMake targets of FindBoost.cmake:

    find_package(Boost REQUIRED COMPONENTS property_map_parallel)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Boost::property_map_parallel)

or the generated cmake configs via:

    find_package(boost_property_map_parallel REQUIRED CONFIG)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Boost::property_map_parallel)
